In `buildMainPage()`, the **`topic`** field of a note is split on '/' to derive the project and feature segments.

Looking at lines 246-251 of the provided code:

```typescript
for (const n of _notes) {
  const topic = n.topic;
  if (!topic) {
    uncategorized.push(n);
    continue;
  }
  const segments = topic.split('/');
  const project = segments[0];
  const feature = segments[1] || '_general';
```

The `topic` field is split into segments, where `segments[0]` becomes the project name and `segments[1]` becomes the feature name (defaulting to `'_general'` if absent).
